# Heartbeat devices.
#
#   <id>=<token>
#
# The token identifies the device; the API maps it back to the id, so firmware
# only ever sends the token. Generate entries with add-device.sh, do not hand
# edit unless you mean to.
#
#   pi=...        the Raspberry Pi, beating over SSH (no token needed)
#   esp8266=...   a microcontroller POSTing /heartbeat
#
# This file is installed at /etc/workshop-api.devices, mode 0600.
